A = {
240: """I send text messages most often during my lunch break and in the evening. At lunch, after eating at the company canteen, I usually have about twenty minutes free, so I check my phone and reply to messages from my friends and family. In the evening, after my daughter goes to bed, I'm usually lying on the sofa, and that's when I chat with my friends the most. I also send quick messages to my wife during the day, for example, to ask what we need to buy for dinner or to tell her if I have to work late. As for who I exchange messages with, my wife is definitely the person I text the most. I also text my close friends in our group chat, my parents, and my coworkers. With my coworkers, the messages are mostly about work, like schedules and reports, so they're usually short and to the point.""",
241: """A memorable text message I received was from my wife about six years ago. At that time, I was on a business trip in Ho Chi Minh City for a week. One afternoon, while I was in a long, boring meeting, my phone buzzed. It was a message from my wife with a photo of a pregnancy test showing two lines, and under it, she wrote, "You're going to be a dad!" I was so shocked and happy that I almost shouted in the middle of the meeting. I couldn't focus on anything for the rest of the day, and I called her as soon as the meeting ended. What made that message so special was that it completely changed my life. I still keep that message on my phone, and sometimes I show it to my daughter and tell her that was the first time I knew about her.""",
242: """I had trouble sending a text message about two years ago, and it was quite stressful. I was traveling to a mountain area in the north with my family for the weekend. On the second day, my coworker sent me a message asking me to confirm some important information for a customer report that had to be sent that afternoon. The problem was that we were in a small village high in the mountains, and the phone signal was very weak. I typed my reply, but the message kept failing. I tried restarting my phone and moving to different places, but nothing worked. In the end, I asked a local shop owner, and she told me the signal was better at the top of a small hill nearby. So I walked up there, and finally, the message went through, just in time. Since then, I always tell my team when I'll be in remote areas.""",
243: """I have a few identification cards now. The most important one is my citizen ID card. It has a chip inside, and it shows my photo, full name, date of birth, and address. I use it whenever I need to prove my identity, for example, when I open a bank account, check in at a hotel, take a domestic flight, or do paperwork at a government office. These days, I can also use a digital version on my phone through an official app, which is very convenient. I also have a driver's license, which I need when I ride my motorbike or drive a car, and I always carry it in my wallet. At work, I have an employee ID card, which I use every day to go through the security gates and to pay for lunch at the canteen. And I also have a health insurance card that I use when I go to the hospital.""",
244: """Let me tell you about the process I went through when I got my new chip-based ID card a few years ago. First, I checked the requirements online and found out which police office handled ID cards in my area. Then I went there on a weekday morning with my old ID card and my family registration information. When I arrived, there was a long line, so I took a number and waited for about an hour. When it was my turn, an officer checked my documents and asked me to confirm my personal information on a computer screen. After that, they took my photo and scanned my fingerprints on a machine. I also had to sign a form. The officer gave me a receipt with the date when the card would be ready. About three weeks later, I received a message, and I went back to the office to pick up my new card.""",
245: """I got my first identification card when I was fourteen, which was the age when everyone in Vietnam had to apply for one at that time. I remember my father took me to the local police office on a Saturday morning. I was really excited, because it made me feel like an adult. I even wore my best white shirt for the photo, and I tried to look serious. When the card was ready a few weeks later, I felt very proud. It was a small, laminated card with my photo, my name, my date of birth, my hometown, and my fingerprints on the back. The funny thing is that the photo looked terrible. My hair was too short, and I looked very surprised. My friends laughed at it for weeks. But it was still special, because it was the first official document that was really mine.""",
246: """Excuse me, hello. I just saw the big sign outside saying you're having a sale. Could I ask you a few questions about it? First, which products are on sale? Is it everything in the store, or only some items, like clothes or shoes? Second, how big are the discounts? The sign says up to fifty percent off. Which items have the biggest discounts? Third, how long will the sale last? Is it just this weekend, or for the whole month? Also, can I use my membership card to get an extra discount on sale items? And if I buy something on sale, can I still return or exchange it if it doesn't fit? Finally, is the same sale available on your website, too? Sometimes it's easier for me to shop online. Thank you very much for your help.""",
247: """Hello, my name is Minh. I bought an electric kettle at your store this afternoon during the sale. Unfortunately, when I got home and opened the box, I noticed that the kettle is damaged. There's a big crack on the side, and when I filled it with water to test it, water leaked out onto the table. So I can't use it at all, and it could even be dangerous. I still have the receipt and the original box. I'd like to resolve this situation as soon as possible. Ideally, I'd like to exchange it for a new kettle of the same model. I could bring it back to the store tomorrow evening after work. If you don't have the same model anymore, I'd be happy to choose a similar one, or I'd like to get a full refund. Could you please let me know what I should do? Thank you.""",
248: """Yes, I once bought a pair of wireless earbuds that didn't work properly. It was about a year ago. I bought them online during a big sale, because they were much cheaper than usual. When they arrived, they looked fine, but after using them for a few days, I noticed that the right earbud kept disconnecting from my phone, and sometimes there was no sound at all. At first, I thought it was a problem with my phone, so I tried restarting it and connecting the earbuds to my wife's phone, but the problem was the same. So I contacted the seller through the shopping app and sent them a video showing the problem. They apologized and asked me to send the earbuds back. About a week later, they sent me a new pair, which worked perfectly. Since then, I'm more careful about buying electronics during big sales.""",
249: """Hello, good morning. I'd like to buy a train ticket to Hue for this weekend, because I'm going to visit a friend there. Could I ask you a few questions? First, what time do the trains leave on Friday evening? I'd prefer a night train, so I can sleep on the way. Second, what kinds of seats or beds do you have? Is there a sleeper cabin with four beds, and how much does it cost? Third, how long does the trip take, and what time does the train arrive in Hue? Also, I'd like to buy a return ticket for Sunday afternoon. Are there still tickets available for that day? And finally, can I pay by card or QR code, or do I need to pay in cash? Thank you very much for your help.""",
250: """Hi Hoang, it's Minh. I'm so sorry, but I have a problem. I just got to the train station, and I missed my train to Hue by about five minutes. There was a terrible traffic jam on the way because of an accident, and my taxi was stuck for almost half an hour. So I won't be able to arrive this evening as we planned. I'm really sorry. I have a few ideas. First, there's another train that leaves at eleven tonight, so I could take that one and arrive early tomorrow morning. Second, if that train is full, I could take a sleeper bus tonight instead. Or third, if it's easier for you, I could come tomorrow afternoon, and we can just change our plans a little. Please let me know which option works best for you. Again, I'm so sorry. Talk to you soon.""",
251: """Yes, I missed a flight once, and it was a really stressful experience. It happened about four years ago. I was going to Da Nang for my cousin's wedding. My flight was at seven in the morning, so I planned to leave home at five. But that morning, my alarm didn't go off, and I woke up at five thirty. I rushed out of the house and took a taxi to the airport, but there was traffic on the way. When I arrived, the check-in counter had already closed, and they wouldn't let me board. I was really upset, because the wedding was that evening. First, I went to the airline's ticket counter and asked about other flights. Luckily, there was a flight at noon, but I had to pay a fee to change my ticket. I arrived in Da Nang just in time for the wedding. Since then, I always set two alarms.""",
252: """Hello, is this the Mobile World store? I'm thinking of buying a new smartphone, and I'd like to ask a few questions. I'm interested in the newest model from the brand I'm using now. First, do you have it in stock, and what colors are available? I'd prefer black or dark blue. Second, how much is it? Are there any promotions at the moment, for example, a discount if I trade in my old phone? Third, can I pay in installments? If so, what's the monthly payment, and is there any interest? Also, how long is the warranty, and what does it cover? And one more thing. If I buy the phone and I'm not satisfied, can I return it within a few days? Finally, what time is your store open on Saturday? I'd like to come and try the phone before I buy it. Thank you.""",
253: """Hello, my name is Minh. I bought a new smartphone from your store online last week, and I received it two days ago. Unfortunately, the features are not what I expected. When I ordered it, the website said it had 256 gigabytes of storage and a three-camera system, but the phone I received only has 128 gigabytes and two cameras. I think you may have sent me a different model by mistake. I need the bigger storage, because I take a lot of photos and videos. So I'd like to return this phone and get the correct model. Could you arrange for someone to pick it up, or should I bring it to your store? If the correct model isn't available right now, I'm happy to wait a few days, or I'd like a full refund. The phone is still in perfect condition, with the box and all the accessories. Please call me back. Thank you.""",
254: """Yes, I once bought a smartwatch that was different from what I expected. It was about a year and a half ago. I wanted a smartwatch to track my steps and my heart rate when I go jogging. I saw an advertisement online, and it looked great, with a big screen and lots of features, and it was quite cheap. So I ordered it. When it arrived, I was disappointed. The screen was much smaller than it looked in the pictures, and it was hard to read outside in the sun. Also, the step counter wasn't accurate. Sometimes it counted steps even when I was sitting in a car. And the battery only lasted one day, not one week as advertised. I contacted the seller to return it, but they only offered a small refund. In the end, I kept it as a simple clock, and later I saved money to buy a better one.""",
255: """Hello, is this the CGV cinema? I'd like to buy two tickets for this Saturday evening for me and my friend. Could I ask you a few questions? First, what movies are showing on Saturday evening? We're looking for an action movie or a comedy. Second, what times are the shows? We'd like a show after seven o'clock, because we both work until late. Third, how much are the tickets? Are there any discounts for members or for students? Also, could we get two seats together in the middle of the theater? We don't want to sit too close to the screen. And do you have any combo deals with popcorn and drinks? Finally, can I book the tickets over the phone and pay when I arrive, or do I need to pay online now? Thank you very much.""",
256: """Excuse me, hello. My friend and I bought two tickets online for the eight o'clock showing of the new action movie tonight. But when we got here and checked the tickets, we realized there's a mistake. The tickets are for the same movie, but for tomorrow night, not tonight. I'm sure I chose tonight when I booked, and I have the confirmation email on my phone. We came all the way here after work, so we'd really like to watch the movie tonight. I have a few suggestions. First, could you change our tickets to tonight's eight o'clock show, if there are still seats? Second, if that show is full, we could watch the next show at nine thirty instead. Or third, if neither option works, could you give us a refund or a voucher for another day? Thank you for your help.""",
257: """Yes, I had to cancel a trip at the last minute about two years ago. My friends and I had planned a three-day trip to Ha Long Bay. We had booked a cruise and a hotel and paid a deposit. But the day before we were supposed to leave, my daughter suddenly got a high fever, and the doctor said she needed to be watched closely for a few days. Of course, I couldn't leave her, so I had to cancel my part of the trip. First, I called my friends and explained the situation, and they understood. Then I called the travel agency and asked if I could get my money back. They said the deposit was non-refundable, but they let me transfer my booking to another person. Luckily, one of my friends' brothers wanted to go, so he took my place and paid me back. In the end, I didn't lose any money.""",
}
